data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"Dispatch d002 verification complete.\\n\\nI checked out refs/campaign/orchestrator (0cf727b) in ~/hello-app, ran npm install, npm run build (passed), and npm run dev. I inspected the served interface with a headless Chromium/Puppeteer script at viewport 1280×800.\\n\\nVerified against DESIGN.md:\\n- Header title is \\\"Hello App\\\".\\n- Footer reads \\\"Built with @codesweep-ai/ui\\\" and is centered.\\n- Greeting is \\\"Hello, world!\\\", 32px, bold, centered, initially blue from var(--color-info).\\n- Buttons are Blue, Green, Amber, Red in order.\\n- Each button changes the greeting to the expected resolved colour: Blue rgb(96,165,250), Green rgb(52,211,153), Amber rgb(245,158,11), Red rgb(248,113,113).\\n- The active colour button has a solid background (primary variant); the other three are transparent (secondary variant).\\n- All required data-component attributes are present: Header, Footer, Button, Card, Page, AppShell.\\n- package.json lists @codesweep-ai/ui and does not list mermaid, puppeteer, pixelmatch, or pngjs.\\n- The Card is visually centered vertically between the Header and Footer.\\n\\nDeviation found:\\n- The Page component itself does not fill the available viewport height between Header and Footer (rendered height ~169 px vs expected ~704 px). Vertical centering is achieved by an extra wrapper \u003cdiv\u003e with custom inline flex CSS around Page, rather than Page filling the height as DESIGN.md describes. The visual result is correct, but the implementation uses custom inline layout instead of relying solely on the design-system Page component.\\n\\nNo application code was modified. Full report and verification log are in ~/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-report.md and d002-verify-output.txt, and committed to branch cs-sandbox/<QA:1>.<GROUP:1> as QA-REPORT-d002.md and QA-VERIFICATION-d002.txt.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-summary.txt\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_58","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959961,"id":"chatcmpl-39cb37b9f01f4a6f8488993595db1927","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

